Comment: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:03.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,出现钟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.58,0:03:12.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Fate doom and future　dark over light
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:16.17,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru (get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:18.43,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:21.10,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru (get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.47,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:28.85,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,錆びついた　shadow prison　姿潜めて
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:33.40,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,行き場を探しては　I keep my soul in you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,So break out so break out -> To battle the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:38.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Never give up that fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,So break out so break out -> To battle the tension
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:43.41,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Don't let it claim your light rise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.41,0:03:48.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,果てなきを彷徨う　飽く無き声が
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:53.13,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,足枷を解いて　羽ばたくの
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:55.92,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,時間の狭間で召されてく魂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:58.38,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,たとえ全てを焼き尽くされたとし
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:03.06,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,ても　飲み込んで　しまえば
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:07.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,闇を振り翳して　胸に宿すアンサー
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:10.56,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1370,27)}闇中反転　照らして
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:12.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H0000FF&\3a&HFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1365.333,91.001)}Aren't you? 明鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:12.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000FF&\3c&H0000FF&\3a&HFF&\pos(1370.666,35)}Won't you make yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:12.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1720,74.668)} -> 探すの
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:15.15,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,君を守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.15,0:04:17.78,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,そのに呼びかけるから
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:22.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,闇中宣戦　全身全霊　生きてゆく証
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:22.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs31\pos(1184,80)\bord1.2}climb back up unswayed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:25.33,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru(get out get out get out get out)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:27.70,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,Guru-guru-guru-guru
